# Every circuit's lap records in the Hall of Fame (spec M2c section 5) from a dr.cfg whose
# records all differ: an empty one, names in lower and mixed case, eleven letters, a time of
# over 99 minutes, a time with out-of-range parts. Into the Hall of Fame, on to the records and
# Right through all eighteen circuits back to the first, a shot of each. Run with --cfg FILE,
# the dr.cfg that `records_all_config` in crates/headless/tests/menu_run.rs writes to the file
# DEADRALLY_RECORDS_CFG names.
at 89500 shot idle
at 90000 key Down
at 90500 key Down
at 91000 key Return
at 94000 shot fame
at 95000 key space
at 97500 shot rec-00
at 98000 key Right
at 98700 shot rec-01
at 99000 key Right
at 99700 shot rec-02
at 100000 key Right
at 100700 shot rec-03
at 101000 key Right
at 101700 shot rec-04
at 102000 key Right
at 102700 shot rec-05
at 103000 key Right
at 103700 shot rec-06
at 104000 key Right
at 104700 shot rec-07
at 105000 key Right
at 105700 shot rec-08
at 106000 key Right
at 106700 shot rec-09
at 107000 key Right
